{
    "title": "War and Peace: Civil War",
    "description": "Join the ultimate display of strength and strategy that could alter the course of history. As the American Civil War rages on, we require your leadership to direct an army on the battlefield in this strategic, combat-based war game.\r\n\r\nPrepare to lead your army to victory in War and Peace: Civil War Clash. As a commander in the American Civil War, you will need to use real-time strategy to construct your base, train troops, and conquer your enemies. With a variety of military weapons and artillery from 1861 available to you, you must think strategically and act swiftly to outsmart your opponents. Begin your journey to glory on the battlefield.\r\n\r\nUse base building to create your camp, customize your army with infantry, cavalry or cannon units and crush your enemies.\r\n\r\nTake on the challenge of a real-time strategy war game and put your tactics to the test. Resources are scarce and require time to collect, so effective management and research strategies will aid in achieving victory.\r\nCreate and protect your base, pursue your objectives, and employ military tactics to emerge victorious in combat.\r\n\r\n<b>With your use of wit and tactics, lead the troops in battle and become a warfare hero!</b>\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n<b>American Civil War Game</b>\r\n\u2022 Immerse yourself in the America of 1861, siding with either the Union or Confederacy\r\n\u2022 Command massive armies into epic battles\r\n\u2022 Multiplayer strategy and tactics determine the battle's outcome\r\n\u2022 Battle maps based on historical Civil War confrontations\r\n\r\n<b>Strategy Game</b>\r\n\u2022 Use Civil War-era military weapons and artillery\r\n\u2022 Recruit commanders to give your armies a tactical edge\r\n\u2022 Command and conquer a massive army of soldiers and become a military hero\r\n\u2022 Develop and defend your base of operations\r\n\r\n<b>Online Multiplayer War Game</b>\r\n\u2022 Engage your army against global players in PvP battles\r\n\u2022 Form alliances with other players to gain an advantage over enemies\r\n\u2022 Chat and cooperate with allies about battleplan maneuvers and watch their backs\r\n\u2022 Compete against rival Alliances for incredible rewards\r\n\r\n<b>Civil War Units Recruiting Games</b>\r\n\u2022 Establish a military base and lead your army against the enemy\r\n\u2022 Manage soldiers and develop tactics to win this epic war\r\n\u2022 Use revolutionary thinking and military tactics to outwit your foes\r\n\u2022 Step into USA history and be part of the country's defining war\r\n\u2022 Conquer battles without the aid of tanks or battleships\r\n\r\nStay up to date with the latest news by joining our community.\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/warandpeacegame\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/Aj4XSWrYs9\r\n\r\nWar and Peace: Civil Clash is a completely free-to-play strategy game, but some game items can be purchased for real money. If you do not want to use this feature, please set up password protection for purchases in the settings of your Google Play Store app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join the ultimate display of strength and strategy that could alter the course of history. As the American Civil War rages on, we require your leadership to direct an army on the battlefield in this strategic, combat-based war game.<br><br>Prepare to lead your army to victory in War and Peace: Civil War Clash. As a commander in the American Civil War, you will need to use real-time strategy to construct your base, train troops, and conquer your enemies. With a variety of military weapons and artillery from 1861 available to you, you must think strategically and act swiftly to outsmart your opponents. Begin your journey to glory on the battlefield.<br><br>Use base building to create your camp, customize your army with infantry, cavalry or cannon units and crush your enemies.<br><br>Take on the challenge of a real-time strategy war game and put your tactics to the test. Resources are scarce and require time to collect, so effective management and research strategies will aid in achieving victory.<br>Create and protect your base, pursue your objectives, and employ military tactics to emerge victorious in combat.<br><br><b>With your use of wit and tactics, lead the troops in battle and become a warfare hero!</b><br><br>Features:<br><b>American Civil War Game</b><br>\u2022 Immerse yourself in the America of 1861, siding with either the Union or Confederacy<br>\u2022 Command massive armies into epic battles<br>\u2022 Multiplayer strategy and tactics determine the battle&#39;s outcome<br>\u2022 Battle maps based on historical Civil War confrontations<br><br><b>Strategy Game</b><br>\u2022 Use Civil War-era military weapons and artillery<br>\u2022 Recruit commanders to give your armies a tactical edge<br>\u2022 Command and conquer a massive army of soldiers and become a military hero<br>\u2022 Develop and defend your base of operations<br><br><b>Online Multiplayer War Game</b><br>\u2022 Engage your army against global players in PvP battles<br>\u2022 Form alliances with other players to gain an advantage over enemies<br>\u2022 Chat and cooperate with allies about battleplan maneuvers and watch their backs<br>\u2022 Compete against rival Alliances for incredible rewards<br><br><b>Civil War Units Recruiting Games</b><br>\u2022 Establish a military base and lead your army against the enemy<br>\u2022 Manage soldiers and develop tactics to win this epic war<br>\u2022 Use revolutionary thinking and military tactics to outwit your foes<br>\u2022 Step into USA history and be part of the country&#39;s defining war<br>\u2022 Conquer battles without the aid of tanks or battleships<br><br>Stay up to date with the latest news by joining our community.<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/warandpeacegame<br>Discord: https://discord.gg/Aj4XSWrYs9<br><br>War and Peace: Civil Clash is a completely free-to-play strategy game, but some game items can be purchased for real money. If you do not want to use this feature, please set up password protection for purchases in the settings of your Google Play Store app.",
